description\\\":\\\"The unittest discovery command succeeds.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-5\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The shared-helper refactor preserves both public functions' signatures, return types, error behavior, import compatibility, and the specified round-robin behavior, and the public API tests cover behavior and input immutability.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read solution.py and test_solution.py. Assess whether round_robin and round_robin_legacy delegate their shared algorithm to one private helper while retaining their signatures, return types, error behavior, imports, and public names; whether the implementation takes one item from each nonempty group in order each round until exhausted, preserves each group's internal order, and does not mutate input collections; whether type hints are maintained; and whether at least two unittest test methods exercise the public API, including meaningful coverage of the stated behavior and immutability. Judge only content visible in these files.\\\"}}],\\\"verification\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}],\\\"stop_conditions\\\":[],\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"The named files are relative to the supplied task workspace; solution.py and test_solution.py may not exist yet and may be created.\\\",\\\"The signatures, return types, imports, and error behavior to preserve are those present in the supplied solution.py, if present; their details were not included in the request.\\\",\\\"The unittest suite is discoverable with the requested command from the task workspace root.\\\",\\\"The request does not specify exact test cases beyond public API exercise, so tests should cover the stated round-robin behavior and input immutability without assuming additional behavior.\\\"]}\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":17410,\"cached_input_tokens\":14976,\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":714,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":0}}\n"}
